cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Computing the entropy rate of a quantized stationary
  Gaussian process: code and results
message: >-
  If you use this software or these results, please cite
  the paper given under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jeremy
    family-names: Magland
    email: jmagland@flatironinstitute.org
    affiliation: Flatiron Institute
repository-code: 'https://github.com/magland/entropy-gaussian-process-paper'
url: 'https://magland.github.io/entropy-gaussian-process-paper/'
abstract: >-
  Code and numerical results accompanying the paper
  "Computing the entropy rate of a quantized stationary
  Gaussian process": a reference Python implementation of
  the analytical approximation and the particle-filter
  estimator (with CPU and WebGPU engines), the scripts and
  JSON results that reproduce every figure and table, the
  LaTeX source of the paper, and an interactive browser
  demonstration.
keywords:
  - entropy rate
  - quantization
  - stationary Gaussian process
  - particle filter
  - lossless compression
license: Apache-2.0
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Computing the entropy rate of a quantized stationary Gaussian process
  authors:
    - given-names: Jeremy
      family-names: Magland
  year: 2026
